\newlabel{tab:techswing}{{2}{13}{The leading penalty at the five-year proof inside technology, by class and by cell. Top-minus-bottom lead-quintile contrast in failure (pp, SE in parentheses), settled registrations, by filing era. The upper block assigns quintiles within each class and era. The lower block pools the four classes and assigns quintiles within the era (raw), within class$\times $registration-cohort cells, and within theme$\times $class$\times $registration-year cells, where a filing's theme is the one its description loads most heavily on under the production $T = 50$ model. $n = 1{,}248{,}591$}{table.caption.6}{}}
