\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {10}{\ignorespaces Every stage of the record under one specification. Each row is a linear probability model of the stage's outcome on standardized lead (red) and atypicality (blue), with log description length and class$\times $debut-year fixed effects, on the population in parentheses; one row per debut owner. Coefficients are expressed as a percentage of the stage's base rate; bars are 95\% intervals on heteroskedasticity-robust errors. The Form~D rows count a notice filed at any time, including before the owner's first trademark filing, unlike the post-debut round of Figure~\ref {fig:ladder}. The year-ten row is restricted to 2002--2013 registrations and the Form~D rows to 2009--2018 debuts.}}{22}{figure.caption.13}\protected@file@percent }
